Z||000034||JSocha||08-28-2001||03:24 PM||||Isn't it the AMPS that kill you (I understand it takes less then a 1/16 of an AMP to kill you) not the volts (unless of course you are being hit by GIGAVOLTS).<P>9 Volt battery in an Ohm meter?  I just tried mine and I can't even get a buzz off of it.  Think of me to try.<P>"Here Jeff.  Hold on to the two copper ends of these wires while I go flip the switch."<P><B>CLICK!  Phhhyyyyzzzzzaaattttt!</B><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.twinoaks4fun.com/images/beavis_hell.jpg"> <P>Anyways, as I was saying, the kid must have had a pacemaker.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
