Z||000039||JSocha||08-28-2001||03:50 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><B>stick your tongue on a 9V battery - and hold it there.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>&lt;slurring&gt; Ohcayyy Ken, now vhat?  <P>It just tingles and I'm using a new 9 volt battey fresh out of the package.<P>AH! Just a second! I think my heart just skipped a beat!  I bess quit while I'm still alive!<P>Actually, as a child, I use to grab the 9-volt batteries out of anything that I could to get that copper taste from the buzz.<P>Also, my dad, as well as I, can grab the electrical wires (from an outlet/light switch) and hold onto them.  Tingles alot more and numbs you faster...but I'm still hear.<P>Its the peeing on electric fences that does me in... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> yowsa  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> !  Thats a tingling feeling you never forget, let alone ever wish to experience again!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||10
