Z||000062||Ken Wittlief||08-29-2001||11:27 AM||||hey that would be a great way to stop kids from p'ing in the pool. Pure water is not conductive, but add a little salt and it is.<P> put pure water in your swimming pool, and the leads from an electic fence transformer. The kids wont get a shock, until someone P's.<P> [ut oh - here comes cliff with the disclaimer again - Im just kidding people - I hope babelfish.com can translate this stuff correctly - hate to be responsible for a bunch of kids floating face down in a swimming pool in france]||||reg||1
